{"ts_utc": "2026-05-12T16:09:19.462314Z", "run_id": "20260512_160855_rag_L3_B6_bdce72", "seq": 5, "event": "generation.completed", "payload": {"answer": "Parliament discussed agriculture-related topics, including:\n\n* The distribution of fertilizers to farmers [<chunk_id: aedd5028b2847c0fd91b6e3cc9982d734ba3db59f0ad2be81d14ca44ebf90478:81>]\n* The provision of subsidized farm inputs, including seeds and fertilizers, through the Planting for Food and Jobs (PFJ) program [<chunk_id: ac3d47059b7a4c74c6acd64cfd59ca70bc3d6b6bf35b7bbc438440cc9e0ae2e5:5>]\n* The establishment of Farm Service Centres as one-stop shops for farmers to access agriculture mechanization services, high-quality seeds, fertilizers, and extension services [<chunk_id: cc72c8f414ba98a37132751f20d36ff71cbdc2573138c346017d3018378ff147:53>]\n* The coordination of policies between the Ministry of Food and Agriculture and the Ministry of Trade, Agribusiness, and Industry to avoid duplication and ensure coherence [<chunk_id: ac3d47059b7a4c74c6acd64cfd59ca70bc3d6b6bf35b7bbc438440cc9e0ae2e5:5>]\n\nNote that these topics were discussed in the context of ensuring food security and supporting farmers, particularly in areas affected by drought.", "answer_sha256": "1660ce780251da032a29a1f614b9b6795cfa9937c156370770ff1a13fc43cd91"}, "prev_hash": "b4196f924f09568dda50cb2076fd06455b555fddd38085686cc0a419768d91a1", "event_hash": "a4aef2db8a50122acbbc2cfd8599c3c5f8a3261523672efee3c9f9ca88b4816c"}
